演义中崔谅的故事（两版本高度一致）：

[indent]•  接到假消息（孔明所设「裴绪」计谋）出兵救南安，被关兴、张苞前后夹击[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#0066FF][url={"research": "魏延", "cat": "people"}]魏延[/url][/color]夤夜取了安定，崔谅无处可归[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  被迫投降孔明，随后诈降，欲引蜀军入南安城中杀之[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  被孔明识破，关兴斩杨陵，张苞一枪刺崔谅于马下[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


